      <p>When you use our contact or used-machine form, we process the data you enter (name, company, email address, phone number if given, subject or model sought, and your message) in order to handle your enquiry. The form data is transmitted and temporarily stored via the form service of our hosting provider <strong>Netlify, Inc.</strong> (address see Section 2) before being delivered to us by email. Access to enquiries is limited to the employees responsible for handling them and the technical service provider we have commissioned to maintain the website. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR (pre-contractual measures) and Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (responding to your enquiry). Transfer to the USA is based on the EU Standard Contractual Clauses; Netlify is listed under the EU–US Data Privacy Framework. Your data is deleted once your enquiry has been conclusively handled and no statutory retention obligations apply.</p>

