      <h2>3b. Contact by email, phone or WhatsApp</h2>
      <p>If you contact us by email or phone, we process the information you provide (e.g. name, email address, phone number, content of your enquiry) to handle your request. The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR where your enquiry relates to a contract or its initiation, and Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR otherwise. The data is deleted once your enquiry has been conclusively handled and no statutory retention obligations apply.</p>
      <p>Our contact page contains a link to <strong>WhatsApp</strong>. Simply visiting our website does not transmit any data to WhatsApp. Only if you click the link and write to us via WhatsApp does WhatsApp Ireland Limited, Merrion Road, Dublin 4, D04 X2K5, Ireland, process your data (including phone number, message content and metadata); a transfer to Meta Platforms, Inc. in the USA is possible. Use is voluntary; you can always reach us by email or phone instead. Information on data protection at WhatsApp is available at <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy-eea" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">whatsapp.com/legal/privacy-policy-eea</a>.</p>

