      <p>All typefaces used on this website are served locally from our own server (self-hosting). When a page is loaded, <strong>no</strong> connections to Google Fonts or other third parties are made, and no personal data (in particular no IP address) is transmitted to third parties.</p>

      <h2>5. Cookies and consent management</h2>
      <p>We use cookies and similar technologies in accordance with § 25 TDDDG (German Telecommunications Digital Services Data Protection Act) and Art. 6 GDPR. The categories we use are explained below:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Technically necessary (no consent required):</strong> We store your consent decision in your browser's <em>localStorage</em> under the key <code>liba_consent_v1</code>. This entry contains only your accept/decline decision and is never transmitted to third parties.</li>
