      <p>You may withdraw your consent at any time with effect for the future by clicking "Privacy settings" in the site footer; this also deletes the Google Analytics cookies. Alternatively, you can clear the site data in your browser. Declining cookies does not affect your ability to use this website.</p>

      <h2>6. Google Analytics 4</h2>
      <p>This website uses Google Analytics 4 (GA4), a web analytics service provided by Google Ireland Limited, Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland. GA4 is only activated after your explicit consent: before you consent, no Google script is loaded and no connection to Google is established.</p>
      <p>Using Consent Mode v2, GA4 collects the following data: pages visited, time on site, approximate geographic origin, device type, and traffic source (e.g. search engine, direct visit). Your IP address is transmitted to Google; according to Google, GA4 uses it only to derive the approximate location and does not log or store it. Data are transferred to servers of Google LLC (USA); Google LLC is certified under the EU–US Data Privacy Framework.</p>
      <p>Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR (consent) in conjunction with § 25(1) TDDDG. You may withdraw your consent at any time (see Section 5). Further information is available in <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a> and at <a href="https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6004245" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's information on data protection in Google Analytics</a>.</p>

      <h2>7. Data security</h2>
      <p>For security reasons and to protect the transmission of confidential content, this website uses TLS/SSL encryption. You can recognise an encrypted connection by the "https://" prefix and the padlock icon in your browser's address bar.</p>

      <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
      <p>As a data subject you have the following rights in relation to your personal data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Access</strong> (Art. 15 GDPR): You may request information about the data we process.</li>
